# API Boundaries

Read `apps/api/AGENTS.md`.

- Derive tenant context from authenticated membership; never trust a raw tenant ID.
- Keep D1 migrations forward-compatible and tenant-aware.
- Make webhooks and Queue consumers idempotent.
- Use generated Cloudflare bindings and direct bindings over REST calls.
- Do not buffer unbounded bodies, use global request state, or leave floating promises.
- Redact production errors and logs.
